                        I design with one thing in mind: making the complex feel simple. With a strong eye for detail
                        and a deep appreciation for usability, I focus on creating products that are clear, intuitive,
                        and — hopefully — delightful to use.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Whether I’m wireframing a new feature or refining micro-interactions, I love those small
